message: "If you use PyADQL in your research, software, or other work, please cite it using the following information."

title: "PyADQL"

abstract: >
  PyADQL is a Python library that parses Astronomical Data Query Language
  (ADQL) queries into a typed Python abstract syntax tree (AST).
  ADQL is the IVOA-standardized query language used to query astronomical
  catalogs through the Table Access Protocol (TAP).

